flowchart TD
  A[Admin uploads CSV or XLSX] --> B[Auth role CSRF quota and worker validation]
  B --> C[Preview with field errors and expected reference versions]
  C --> D{Admin confirms?}
  D -->|No| Stop[No reference write]
  D -->|Yes| E{Owned unexpired REFERENCE batch?}
  E -->|No| Reject[Reject safely]
  E -->|Yes| F[Begin transaction and claim batch]
  F --> G{Versions still match?}
  G -->|No| Rollback[Rollback all rows and return 409]
  G -->|Yes| H[Append valid StudentReferenceRecord versions]
  H --> I{Unique conflict?}
  I -->|Yes| Rollback
  I -->|No| J[Save summary and audit then commit]
  J --> K[Admin views latest references]
  J --> L[Existing accounts and passwords unchanged]
